abc
def
-- args a.txt
-- keys
right arg sdelete
-- expect file a.txt
adef
-- expect clipboard stream
bc
~

== name: arg sdelete beyond the end pads first
-- file a.txt
ab
cd
-- args a.txt
-- keys
right right right right arg sdelete
-- expect file a.txt
ab  cd

== name: arg sdelete on the last line takes the rest of it
